{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/MultiAgentCollaboration"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Complex analytical and reasoning workflows are frequently error-prone when performed by a single monolithic model. Decomposing problems into specialized roles—such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Planner","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Analyst","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Critic","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"—drastically improves reasoning accuracy, reduces hallucinations, and permits parallelized tool execution."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftAgent"},{"type":"text","text":" provides "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AgentMessageBus"},{"type":"text","text":", a reactive multi-agent framework built on Swift’s structured concurrency primitives ("},{"code":"AsyncStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTaskGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Architectural Topology","type":"heading","anchor":"Architectural-Topology","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["                         ┌───────────────────────┐","                         │   User \/ Prompt Task  │","                         └───────────┬───────────┘","                                     │","                                     ▼","                       ┌───────────────────────────┐","                       │      AgentMessageBus      │","                       │       (AsyncStream)       │","                       └─────────────┬─────────────┘","                                     │ Broadcasts","         ┌───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┐","         ▼                           ▼                           ▼","┌──────────────────┐       ┌──────────────────┐       ┌──────────────────┐","│     Planner      │       │     Analyst      │       │      Critic      │","│ Decomposes steps │       │ Queries & Models │       │ Validates logic  │","└────────┬─────────┘       └────────┬─────────┘       └────────┬─────────┘","         │                          │                          │","         └──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────┘","                                    │ Parallel Tool Calls","                                    ▼","                     ┌─────────────────────────────┐","                     │ MultiAgentOrchestrator      │","                     │ withTaskGroup Tool Executor │","                     └──────────────┬──────────────┘","                                    │","               ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐","               ▼                                         ▼","      DataFrame Query Tool                      Statistical Model Tool"]},{"text":"Parallel Tool Calling","type":"heading","anchor":"Parallel-Tool-Calling","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When an agent requests multiple tool executions in a single reasoning step (e.g. computing standard deviations across three columns concurrently), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator.executeToolsInParallel(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" executes them simultaneously across available CPU cores using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTaskGroup"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This reduces total latency from $\\sum_{i=1}^M T_i$ to $\\max_{i} T_i$."}]},{"text":"Example Usage","type":"heading","anchor":"Example-Usage","level":2}